# SIMULATION (model curve), NOT an observation. Qin & Wyithe (2026), arXiv:2607.25722 (submitted to MNRAS), Fig. 8 (bottom panel, solid curve):
#   comoving ionizing emissivity, galaxies + AGN, smoothed as plotted in the paper: savgol_filter(window_length=15,
#   polyorder=1) over the snapshots (changes the raw snapshot values by a few per cent, up to ~30% at z > 12),
#   z <= 13.5 (the range of the figure).
#   Model "SFR" of Table 1: f_esc^gal = 0.06 (SFR/1 Msun yr^-1)^-0.33; tau_e = 0.0571.
#   Meraxes semi-analytic galaxy formation with semi-numerical (excursion-set) reionization on a (210 h^-1 cMpc)^3 N-body
#   volume with merger trees augmented to the atomic-cooling limit; f_esc^gal of the model calibrated to the XQR-30+ Lya
#   forest tau_eff distributions (Planck 2015 cosmology, h = 0.6751).
